OL,3,AMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FNHS England says the outage is
OL,9,F"inevitably" disrupting staff but
OL,10,Fappointments can continue; schools ask
OL,11,Fparents to get in touch via phone not
OL,12,Femail; US federal government and court
OL,13,Fsystems are also reporting issues
OL,15,FHow are you affected? Georgia, from
OL,16,FStaffordshire, says the outage has
OL,17,Fdelayed the completion of her first
OL,18,Fhouse purchase. Meanwhile, South
OL,19,FAfrican winemaker Peter Pentz says
OL,20,Fcommunication with his European
OL,21,Fexporters has been brought "to a
OL,22,Fstandstill"
